  abilityName: Exsequiae
  abilityDesc: 28 combo Fire attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    12 combo Fire attack on single foe (25% active Pierce on Fire, Earth foes), fills
    BB gauge for 4 turns, boosts Fire elemental damage for 4 turns, 100% damage reduction
    for 4 turns & activates BB/SBB/UBB twice for 3 turns
